{"title":"Preguntar y negar en pasado","summary":"Formar preguntas con did y negativas con didn't sin alterar el verbo principal.","theory_extra":"<h2>Objetivo</h2><p>Formar preguntas con did y negativas con didn't sin alterar el verbo principal.</p><h2>Explicación</h2><p>Para preguntar por acciones terminadas se usa Did + sujeto + verbo base. En negativas: sujeto + didn't + verbo base. La marca de pasado está en did, por eso es incorrecto Did you went?; la forma correcta es Did you go?</p><h2>Diálogo original</h2><p>Iris: Did you call Ana yesterday?<br>Max: No, I didn't. I sent a message.<br>Iris: Did she reply?<br>Max: Yes, she did, this morning.</p><div class=\"tip\">Practicá el diálogo en voz alta. Inventá dos respuestas nuevas y comprobá el orden de las palabras.</div><div class=\"warn\">No traduzcas mecánicamente desde el español: prestá atención a auxiliares y preposiciones.</div>","vocab":[["yesterday","ayer"],["reply","responder"],["send","enviar"],["message","mensaje"],["call","llamar"],["morning","mañana"]],"exercises":[["mcq","Did you ___ the film?",["saw","see","seen"],1,"Después de did va el infinitivo sin to."],["fill","I ___ go to work yesterday. (negativa)",["didn't","did not"],"Didn't + go."],["mcq","¿Cuál es correcta?",["Did she called?","Did she call?","Does she called?"],1,"Did + call en forma base."],["order","Ordená la pregunta.","Did they arrive on time?","Did inicia la pregunta."],["listen","¿Respondió Ana?","Yes, Ana replied this morning.",["Sí","No","No se sabe"],0,"Yes confirma la respuesta."],["dictation","Escribí la oración.","I didn't see him yesterday.","Didn't va con see, no saw."],["fill","___ you visit your family last week?",["Did"],"Last week indica pasado."],["mcq","Respuesta breve a Did you go?",["Yes, I did.","Yes, I do.","Yes, I am."],0,"Se responde con did."],["order","Ordená la negativa.","She didn't buy a ticket.","Después de didn't usamos buy."],["speak","Formulá una pregunta sobre ayer.","Did you study English yesterday?